  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">中世紀建築系列迎來了為終界打造的全新版本！探索五座令人驚嘆的新中世紀風格建築，它們將出現在終界奇幻的島嶼上。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您喜歡冒險，這個選項非常適合您，因為所有建築都充滿了寶藏，當然還有陷阱和敵人。您一定會愛上這個維度的體驗！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">別忘了下載中世紀建築的主版本！<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊這裡！</span></a></strong><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">地獄維度版本也已推出！<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings-nether-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊這裡！</span></a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要一個伺服器與朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找一個伺服器來和好友一起玩任何模組或模組包，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a>是您的解決方案！他們提供品質價格比最佳的Minecraft伺服器，點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此連結</strong></a>並使用折扣碼「Lupin」，即可享有25%折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此模組為終界維度新增了五種新建築，全部採用中世紀風格，將與您的遊戲完美融合。最棒的是，它與絕大多數修改終界生成的模組完美相容！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您是建築、美麗建築物，甚至是歷史的愛好者，這個模組可能非常適合您的遊戲。將其加入您的模組包，享受全新終界建築的生成吧！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">所有建築均由：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/emberunholy/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">emberunholy</a>&nbsp;設計</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它與其他新增建築的模組相容嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">毫無疑問，它與任何其他模組（無論是建築還是生態域）都完全相容。不過對於生態域，新建築只會出現在與初始設定特徵相似的生態域中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以在哪裡找到新建築？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">僅限於終界維度，在擊敗終界龍後可到達的島嶼上。它們會隨機生成，並遵循特定參數以避免過於頻繁。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它能在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！它運作完美！請記住，與朋友一起玩模組的最佳方式是使用BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結即可獲得25%折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個模組可以用在模組包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！但僅限於發佈在Modrinth或CurseForge上。上傳到任何其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，且完全不被允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果您考慮將其加入您的Modrinth或CurseForge模組包，我們非常感激。如果您需要任何小改動或有任何疑問，請聯繫我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製這個模組的影片並在我的頻道上展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以，您可以自由地在您的頻道上遊玩這個模組或我們的任何模組包，並製作相關影片，事實上，我們會非常感激！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/710/medieval-buildings.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/712/medieval-buildings-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/713/medieval-buildings-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/714/medieval-buildings-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/716/medieval-buildings-8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
